t. 
|  In addition, we thank Associate Professor Margaret B. Drew, University
|  of Massachusetts, Dartmouth School of Law, for her meticulous review
|  of our lengthy manuscript. Her insightful, substantive, and practical
|  editing suggestions were very much appreciated, as it helped to sharpen
|  and clarify the content of this book. Professor Drew’s powerful and
|  cogent foreword provides an excellent introduction to the entrenched
|  problems affecting the family courts throughout the country and, in particular, the plight of mothers who appeal to custody judges to protect
.  their children from abuse committed by the other parent

