r#  5177  66  23
p: .
t. 
|  Sadly, Jeremiah (Jerry) passed away several years after the publication of the first edition, but his scholarly memoranda and letters to
|  government officials are still cited today. His devoted wife, Nettie, never
|  forgets to send a sweet note to us at the outset of every holiday, both secular and religious. Through her encouraging words, she has kept Jerry’s
.  legacy very much alive

--- Sentence/end 
